      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "李汉对他说：“昨天你做得很好！”",
      "traditional": "李漢對他說：“昨天你做得很好！”",
      "pinyin": "lǐ hàn duì tā shuō zuó tiān nǐ zuò de hěn hǎo",
      "english": "Li Han said to him, “Yesterday, you did very well!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "“谢谢！”那个人说，“我给了昨天开车来的人一个人一百块钱。",
      "traditional": "“謝謝！”那個人說，“我給了昨天開車來的人一個人一百塊錢。",
      "pinyin": "xiè xie nà ge rén shuō wǒ gěi le zuó tiān kāi chē lái de rén yí ge rén yì bǎi kuài qián",
      "english": "“Thank you!” the person said, “I gave everyone who drove over yesterday each 100 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "昨天，他们都在九点开车来到了，停在我们的旁边。两个小时，谁也开不了车。”",
      "traditional": "昨天，他們都在九點開車來到了，停在我們的旁邊。兩個小時，誰也開不了車。”",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān tā men dōu zài jiǔ diǎn kāi chē lái dào le tíng zài wǒ men de páng biān liǎng ge xiǎo shí shéi yě kāi bù liǎo chē",
      "english": "Yesterday, they all drove over at 9 o’clock, and stopped beside us. For two hours, nobody was able to drive anywhere.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
