      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“做得很好！”李汉笑了，说：“这是给你的，一万块钱。昨天谢谢你！”",
      "traditional": "“做得很好！”李漢笑了，說：“這是給你的，一萬塊錢。昨天謝謝你！”",
      "pinyin": "zuò de hěn hǎo lǐ hàn xiào le shuō zhè shì gěi nǐ de yí wàn kuài qián zuó tiān xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": "“You did very well!” Li Han smiled, saying, “This is for you, 10,000 yuan. Thanks for yesterday!”"
    },
