    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "那个人拿了钱，也笑了：“你的儿子和她在一起了？”",
      "traditional": "那個人拿了錢，也笑了：“你的兒子和她在一起了？”",
      "pinyin": "nà ge rén ná le qián yě xiào le nǐ de ér zi hé tā zài yì qǐ le",
      "english": "The person took the money and smiled, “Your son is going out with her now?”"
    },
    {
